name floatrowbytocbasic
category Package
revision 67946
shortdesc An enhancement to package floatrow using package tocbasic
relocated 1
longdesc This package adds usage of package tocbasic to package
longdesc floatrow. This not only improves compatibility with KOMA-Script
longdesc but also adds several new features to floatrow like optional
longdesc automatic entries to the table of contents for the lists of new
longdesc floats, optional numbering of the lists of new floats etc.
runfiles size=2
 RELOC/tex/latex/floatrowbytocbasic/floatrowbytocbasic.sty
